guide forever/alliance/06-ashenvale
title Ashenvale, Wetlands & Stonetalon Mountains
faction Alliance
levels 25-29
zone Ashenvale
next forever/alliance/07-thousand-needles

# Ashenvale, Stonetalon, the Wetlands, Ironforge and Stormwind, Alliance
# ~25.4 to ~28.2.
#
# Route from the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export, visits
# 6-10: Ashenvale 25.4-26.6, Stonetalon 26.6-27, Wetlands 27-28.1, Ironforge
# and Stormwind 28.1-28.2), written out as a playable guide; not play-tested
# on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: boat Stormwind -> Auberdine, ride south -> Grove of the Ancients
# (Kerlonian) -> Maestra's Post -> Bathran's Haunt -> Maestra's Post ->
# Astranaar (flight path, hearth) -> west: Teronis, the Shrine of Aessina,
# Ilkrud, the Zoram Strand, Maestra's Post -> hearth to Astranaar -> east:
# Dal Bloodclaw, Elune's Tear -> Astranaar -> the Howling Vale, the
# Foulweald, Mystral Lake, the Ruins of Stardust -> hearth to Astranaar ->
# the Talondeep Path to Stonetalon's Windshear Crag -> hearth to
# Astranaar, fly to Auberdine, boat to Menethil Harbor -> Menethil, Bluegill
# Marsh, the hovels -> east: crocolisks, Whelgar's Excavation Site, the
# oozes, the Green Belt, Dun Modr -> hearth to Menethil -> ride to Ironforge
# -> tram to Stormwind.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - The Sleeper Has Awakened (5321): 03-darkshore accepts it at the Grove of
#   the Ancients; the escort is walked on the way in, from the grove to
#   Liladris at Maestra's Post, as the export completes and turns it in here.
# - Local order fixed for one pass per hub: The Tower of Althalaxx (970) is
#   taken on the first visit to Delgren; Wolves, Elune's Tear and the east
#   quests run in one loop between the two hearths.
# - Wetlands: Digging Through the Ooze (470) and Young Crocolisk Skins (484)
#   are done in the east where their mobs live (the export did them before
#   leaving Menethil) and turned in after the hearth. Apprentice's Duties
#   (471) is accepted then and finished on the north coast in the next
#   guide's Wetlands return, beside the Third Fleet's wreck (the export did
#   it at 27.2-27.4).
# - An Old Colleague (1072) is turned in to Lomac Gearstrip as you pass
#   through Ironforge (the export carries it to 59.6).
# - The Stormwind hearth bind (28.1) is dropped: the export rebinds in
#   Darkshire at once (next guide).
# - Look To The Stars (174): the Bronze Tube was bought in Darkshire (previous
#   guide), so nothing to loot in Stonetalon.
# - Menethil Statuette: Return the Statuette (98189) and both A Friend of the
#   Family steps (98190, 98191) follow Karl Boran's chain through Menethil
#   Keep, Stormwind Keep and the Cathedral; The Shamed Lieutenant (98219) is
#   carried to Southshore.
# - Refresh (2026): Making Do (97926, Forever: Baros Alexston's reply from
#   the Stormwind stop in 04-redridge-mountains) goes to Thundris Windweaver
#   as the boat lands in Auberdine. Alchemical Hazards (98282, Forever, from
#   the new consensus's Wetlands visit): Caitlin Grassman in Menethil wants a
#   gland from the stalkers of Thelgen Rock, beside the raptor quests. The
#   Powers Below (968), only with the book from Darkshore, is handed in at
#   the Ironforge stop.
# - The new consensus runs Ashenvale right after Darkshore (21-23) and the
#   Wetlands before Redridge and Duskwood; the guides keep their zone order
#   and the Forever Ashenvale quests of its 29-30 visit (98027, 98418,
#   95737, 86757) are in 30-40/03-ashenvale.
# - Menethil Harbor: Karl Boran (279), on the pier, is taken first off the
#   boat and Caitlin Grassman (98282) next to Sida. Stormwind Keep: Bolvar
#   (98190) before the Royal Library, on the way in.
#
# Class quests: on arrival in Auberdine, Night Elf Druids finish Trial of the
# Sea Lion and Aquatic Form (272, 5061: Moonglade, then Darnassus) and Night
# Elf Priests hand in Elune's Grace (5673) in Darnassus, both by the free
# Rut'theran flight; in Ironforge, Dwarf and Gnome Priests hand in Chastise
# (5645) and Contingency Plan (94819). Class training in Ironforge, Druids
# in Stormwind (Ironforge has no druid trainer).
# Paladins: A Strange Artifact (78088, level 30, from 22) starts at the
# Strange Orb atop the Tower of Althalaxx in Darkshore and runs through
# Delgren at Maestra's Post, Stormwind, Redridge and Demon Fall Canyon to the
# Cloak of the Divine Storm: the Class guide
# forever/class/paladin/cloak-of-the-divine-storm.
#
# Left out (the export accepts them but never turns them in): Journey to
# Stonetalon Peak (1056), Pridewings of Stonetalon (1134), Mage Summoner
# (1017), Supplies to Auberdine (976), Further Instructions (1094), The Day
# After (2927), Tinkmaster Overspark (2923), Retrieval for Mauren (1078),
# Devils in Westfall (1076), The Corruption Abroad (3765), Brother Paxton
# (344).
#
# Dropped for flow: Scramble (79980, 200 XP), a ride west to Sun Rock
# Retreat and back for one tiny quest; no grind needed to cover it.
# Checked and skipped: The Tower of Althalaxx (981) needs 1143 (Athrikus
# Narassin, after 1167), which the route never does. The Absent Minded
# Prospector (943) needs 741 and 942 through Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker
# in Darnassus, and its Stone of Relu is a 1.5% raptor drop.
# Dropped: The Zoram Strand (1008): 20 heads from naga 6 levels below you,
# at 80% XP. Remember That I Love You (95161): the Matron offers it only to
# those who bring the Blood-Stained Letter out of the Ruins of Lordaeron
# dungeon.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshore

step Aquatic Form
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine. Join the two half pendants into the Pendant of the Sea Lion and cast Teleport: Moonglade: Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Then fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine).
  collect 15885 quest 272.1                   -- Pendant of the Sea Lion: join the two halves
  turnin 272                                  -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 5061
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to the Cenarion Enclave, then fly back to Auberdine.
  turnin 5061                                 -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Aquatic Form
  fly "Auberdine"

step Elune's Grace
  only NightElf,Priest
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the boat from Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village; Priestess Alathea is in the Temple of the Moon. Then fly back to Auberdine.
  fly "Rut'theran Village"
  turnin 5673                                 -- Priestess Alathea: Elune's Grace
  fly "Auberdine"

step Boat to Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip From Stormwind Harbor take the boat to Auberdine; Thundris Windweaver stands at the north end of the village. Then ride south along the road through Darkshore.
  turnin 97926                                -- Thundris Windweaver: Alexston's reply
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Grove of the Ancients"

step Kerlonian Evershade
  tip Kerlonian sleeps at the Grove of the Ancients in southern Darkshore. Use the Horn of Awakening to wake him and lead him south along the road into Ashenvale to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post; blow the horn again whenever he falls asleep.
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Kerlonian Evershade"
  note Escort Kerlonian to Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Maestra's Post

step Maestra's Post
  zone Ashenvale
  turnin 5321                             -- Liladris Moonriver
  turnin 967                              -- Delgren the Purifier
  accept 970
  accept 1010                             -- Orendil Broadleaf

step Bathran's Haunt
  tip North of Maestra's Post, plant bundles lie around the ruins of Bathran's Haunt. Dark Strand cultists hold the ruins just south of them: any of them can drop the Glowing Soul Gem.
  collect 5437 quest 1010                 -- Bathran's Hair, from the plant bundles
  collect 5366 quest 970                  -- Glowing Soul Gem

step Maestra's Post
  turnin 1010                             -- Orendil Broadleaf
  accept 1020
  turnin 970                              -- Delgren the Purifier
  accept 973

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Astranaar

step Astranaar
  tip Follow the road south-east to Astranaar, on the island in the lake.
  getfp "Astranaar" npc 4267              -- Daelyshia
