# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East

step Dal Bloodclaw
  tip Dal Bloodclaw (25) leads the Thistlefur gnolls at the camp north of Astranaar. Clear his guards first, one at a time.
  collect 5544 quest 1054                 -- Dal Bloodclaw's Skull

step Elune's Tear
  tip The tears glow on the small isle east of Astranaar.
  collect 5493 quest 1033 @46.4,46.4

