  turnin 1054                             -- Raene Wolfrunner
  turnin 1033                             -- Pelturas Whitemoon
  accept 1034

step Shael'dryn
  tip Follow the road east to the Howling Vale; Shael'dryn stands by the moonwell.
  turnin 1024

step The Foulweald
  tip The Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods south of the road, south-east of Astranaar. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den.
  kill 3746 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Den Watcher
  kill 3749 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Ursa
  kill 3750 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Totemic
  kill 3743 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Warrior

step Mystral Lake
  tip Sentinel Velene Starstrike stands at the Silverwind Refuge on the east shore of Mystral Lake; Alonso camps on its west shore. Befouled Water Elementals wade in the lake between them.
  accept 1016                             -- Sentinel Velene Starstrike
  collect 5455 quest 1016 @46.6,69.6      -- Kill the elementals for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then use the Divining Scroll
  turnin 1016
  accept 78132                            -- Alonso
  turnin 78132
  accept 78133
  turnin 78133
  accept 78134
  turnin 78134

step The Ruins of Stardust
  tip West of Mystral Lake, the stardust bushes grow among the ruins.
  collect 5494 quest 1034 @33.3,67.7      -- Handful of Stardust

step Astranaar
  hearth "Astranaar"
  turnin 1034                             -- Pelturas Whitemoon
  turnin 1025                             -- Raene Wolfrunner
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stonetalon Mountains

step Windshear Crag
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Ride south past Mystral Lake into the Talondeep Path tunnel; it comes out in Stonetalon's Windshear Crag. Kaela and Gaxim camp on the Webwinder Path south-west of the crag.
  turnin 1070                             -- Kaela Shadowspear
  accept 1085
  turnin 1085                             -- Gaxim Rustfizzle
  accept 1071
  accept 1093                             -- Ziz Fizziks, in the hut north of them

step Venture Co. loggers
  tip The Venture Co. clear the forest of Windshear Crag. Loggers and Deforesters work all over it; the Operators run the shredders and one carries the blueprints.
  kill 3989 quest 1071                    -- Venture Co. Logger
  kill 3991 quest 1071                    -- Venture Co. Deforester
  collect 5734 quest 1093                 -- Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints

step Piznik
  tip Piznik mines in the Windshear Mine at the east end of the crag. Talk to him and fend off the Venture Co. raiders while he mines.
  accept 1090
  complete 1090
  turnin 1090
  accept 1092

step Webwinder Path
  turnin 1092                             -- Ziz Fizziks
  turnin 1093
  turnin 1071                             -- Gaxim Rustfizzle
  accept 1072
  accept 1075

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Menethil Harbor

step To Menethil Harbor
  zone Darkshore
  hearth "Astranaar"                      -- Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride back north through the Talondeep Path.
  fly "Auberdine"
  goto 32.4,43.8 "Boat to Menethil Harbor"

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  accept 279                              -- Karl Boran, on the pier north of the inn
  getfp "Menethil Harbor" npc 1571        -- Shellei Brondir
  sethome "Deepwater Tavern" npc 1464     -- Innkeeper Helbrek
  accept 463                              -- First Mate Fitzsimmons, in the inn
  accept 470                              -- Sida
  accept 98282                            -- Caitlin Grassman
  accept 98197                            -- Valstag Ironjaw, by the keep
  accept 472                              -- Harlo Barnaby, by the north gate
  accept 484                              -- James Halloran, by the north gate
  accept 305                              -- Tarrel Rockweaver, by the north gate

step Spoils of War
  tip Timber and iron piles lie around the keep and along the harbor's walls.
  collect 279821 quest 98197              -- Khaz Modan Timber
  collect 279822 quest 98197              -- Khaz Modan Iron

step Valstag Ironjaw
  turnin 98197

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bluegill Marsh

step Bluegill Marsh
  tip Follow the coast north out of Menethil. Bluegill Murlocs fill the marsh; Gobbler walks with a pack in the middle of it.
  kill 1024 quest 279                     -- Bluegill Murloc
  collect 3618 quest 279                  -- Gobbler's Head

step Karl Boran
  turnin 279
  accept 281

step The Bluegill hovels
  tip Three containers in the murloc hovels, south to north: the Damaged Crate, then the Sealed Barrel, then the Half-buried Barrel at the north end.
  turnin 281 @13.5,41.4                   -- Damaged Crate
  accept 284
  turnin 284 @13.6,38.2                   -- Sealed Barrel
  accept 285
  turnin 285 @13.9,34.8                   -- Half-buried Barrel
  accept 286

step Karl Boran
  turnin 286
  accept 98189 npc 1242                   -- Karl Boran: for Captain Stoutfist in the keep
  vendor nearest

step Captain Stoutfist
  tip Captain Stoutfist stands in Menethil Keep, a short walk from Karl Boran.
  turnin 98189 npc 2104                   -- Captain Stoutfist
  accept 98190 npc 2104                   -- For Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep: keep it

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East Wetlands

step Young crocolisks
  tip Follow the road east. Young Wetlands Crocolisks lurk in the pools north of the excavation site.
  collect 3397 quest 484                  -- Young Crocolisk Skin

step Whelgar's Excavation Site
  tip The excavation site sits on the hill south of the road.
  turnin 305                              -- Merrin Rockweaver
  accept 306
  accept 294                              -- Ormer Ironbraid

step The raptor hills
  tip Mottled Raptors and Screechers roam the hills west of the excavation site.
  kill 1021 quest 294                     -- Mottled Screecher
  kill 1020 quest 294                     -- Mottled Raptor

step Ormer Ironbraid
  turnin 294
  accept 295

step Raptor valley
  tip The bigger raptors hunt in the valley just west of the dig.
  kill 1022 quest 295                     -- Mottled Scytheclaw
  kill 1023 quest 295                     -- Mottled Razormaw

step Ormer Ironbraid
  turnin 295

step Thelgen Rock
  tip Cave Stalkers and Leech Stalkers fill Thelgen Rock, the cave south-east of the excavation site.
  collect 280319 quest 98282              -- Unruptured Stalker Gland

step Black Oozes
  tip Black Oozes creep through the marsh north of the Green Belt road, west of Einar's camp. Any ooze may hold Sida's bag.
  collect 3349 quest 470                  -- Sida's Bag

step The Green Belt
  tip Einar Stonegrip camps by the road; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands farther east, by the river.
  accept 469                              -- Einar Stonegrip
  turnin 463                              -- Rethiel the Greenwarden
  accept 276

step The Mosshide gnolls
  tip Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels hold the hills south-east of the Green Belt.
  kill 1007 quest 276                     -- Mosshide Gnoll
  kill 1008 quest 276                     -- Mosshide Mongrel

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 276
  accept 277

step Crude Flint
  tip Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks just west and south of Rethiel; almost every one drops flint.
  collect 2611 quest 277

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 277
  accept 275

step Fen Creepers
  tip Fen Creepers hide in the marsh pools north-west of the Green Belt.
  kill 1040 quest 275

step Dun Modr
  tip Follow the road north to Dun Modr, at the foot of the Thandol Span. Longbraid the Grim stands in the dwarves' camp.
  turnin 472                              -- Longbraid the Grim

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 275

step Dragonmaw camp
  tip The Dragonmaw camp lies south of the road, just west of the Green Belt: Raiders, Swamprunners and Bonewarders. Pilot Longbeard's quest in Dun Morogh needs level 28.
  goto 45.7,44.8 "Dragonmaw camp"
  level 28 -- grind on Dragonmaw Raiders and Swamprunners at the Dragonmaw camp, Wetlands

